<title>USA: Taubman Centers Inc Q3 FFO rises.</title>
<headline>Taubman Centers Inc Q3 FFO rises.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD HILLS, Mich. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr funds/oper	  $ 0.25		   $ 0.23</p>
<p> Net funds/oper	  11,036		    9,944</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  44,098		   44,170</p>
<p>	   (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings represent funds from operations.</p>
<p>Q3 EBITDA $58.6 million vs $54.4 million.  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
